        },
        {
          "text": "Nguwe watuzulizizya milimo yamulongo mupya. Oyu mulongo tuuli wamakani aalembedwe buyo, pe, ngwamuuya, nkaambo makani aalembedwe alajaya, anukuti muuya ulapa buumi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.6",
