        },
        {
          "text": "Lino milimo yamakani aalufu aaengwiidwe amabwe, niyakaba abulemu yalo, nkabela bana ba-Israyeli teebakakonzya kudunamina busyu bwa-Musa nkaambo kabulemu bubekesi bwabusyu bwakwe, nekubaboobo obo bubekesi bwakali bwakweela buyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
